<span style="font-size:11px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;border-top:1px solid #e2e5e9;padding-top:6px">
  <b>Legend</b><br>
  <span style="display:inline-block;width:18px;border-top:3px solid #000;vertical-align:middle"></span> solid black — actual geometry<br>
  <span style="display:inline-block;width:18px;border-top:3px dashed #000;vertical-align:middle"></span> dashed black — perceived / assumed<br>
  <span style="display:inline-block;width:18px;border-top:3px solid #ff0000;vertical-align:middle"></span> red — sight lines through pinhole<br>
  <span style="display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:#bebebe;border:1.5px solid #000;vertical-align:middle"></span> gray — objects (both the same real size)
